data: {"type":"toolResult","tool_result":{"call":{"provider":"call_Nf7BeLHTkM49cnPfBsDxMcu1"},"name":"search_world","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Cracked jade compass (compass, object) [ID: 7e23d4d7-7bfd-4ce7-9db3-91d1ebe3ee71]: A cracked jade compass that Mira Venn keeps inside her right boot. Only her friend Oren Dask knows about it.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - ← CARRIES from Mira Venn (person, engineer) [ID: 7d2fec61-8487-4192-8bf3-db75accaaa8f]: An engineer who maintained the Glass Aqueduct before its destruction in 204. She was born in Greyhaven, a small town on the coast, and moved to Sablecross as an adult. She keeps a cracked jade compass inside her right boot; only her friend Oren Dask knows about it.\n  - ← KNOWS_ABOUT from Oren Dask (person) [ID: 4f6cb7f9-103d-41a5-93d2-3ed615a419fa] [Aliases: Warden]: Oren Dask guards the Sablecross reservoir and refuses to let soldiers draw water without a council permit. He is also called the Warden. He is Mira Venn's friend and the only person who knows she keeps a cracked jade compass inside her right boot.\n\nMira Venn (person, engineer) [ID: 7d2fec61-8487-4192-8bf3-db75accaaa8f]: An engineer who maintained the Glass Aqueduct before its destruction in 204. She was born in Greyhaven, a small town on the coast, and moved to Sablecross as an adult. She keeps a cracked jade compass inside her right boot; only her friend Oren Dask knows about it.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - MAINTAINS → Glass Aqueduct (aqueduct) [ID: 0a05f0fd-2132-40c5-b10c-63a7f2b9d187]: The Glass Aqueduct once ran from the Basalt Hills to feed the Sablecross reservoir. The Sablecross council owns it. Mira Venn maintained it before its permanent destruction by a landslide in 204. It has not been rebuilt, and there is no alternate aqueduct or bypass.\n  - MOVED_TO → Sablecross (city) [ID: 1016d1ca-4f7d-4d74-bdc6-6522d6bb1947]: A city in Ardent Reach.\n  - FRIEND_OF → Oren Dask (person) [ID: 4f6cb7f9-103d-41a5-93d2-3ed615a419fa] [Aliases: Warden]: Oren Dask guards the Sablecross reservoir and refuses to let soldiers draw water without a council permit. He is also called the Warden. He is Mira Venn's friend and the only person who knows she keeps a cracked jade compass inside her right boot.\n  - CARRIES → Cracked jade compass (compass, object) [ID: 7e23d4d7-7bfd-4ce7-9db3-91d1ebe3ee71]: A cracked jade compass that Mira Venn keeps inside her right boot. Only her friend Oren Dask knows about it.\n  - BORN_IN → Greyhaven (town, coastal settlement) [ID: 70ce38c9-4472-43bc-8fd0-7733401ad249]: A small town on the coast.\n\nOren Dask (person) [ID: 4f6cb7f9-103d-41a5-93d2-3ed615a419fa] [Aliases: Warden]: Oren Dask guards the Sablecross reservoir and refuses to let soldiers draw water without a council permit. He is also called the Warden. He is Mira Venn's friend and the only person who knows she keeps a cracked jade compass inside her right boot.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - ← FRIEND_OF from Mira Venn (person, engineer) [ID: 7d2fec61-8487-4192-8bf3-db75accaaa8f]: An engineer who maintained the Glass Aqueduct before its destruction in 204. She was born in Greyhaven, a small town on the coast, and moved to Sablecross as an adult. She keeps a cracked jade compass inside her right boot; only her friend Oren Dask knows about it.\n  - KNOWS_ABOUT → Cracked jade compass (compass, object) [ID: 7e23d4d7-7bfd-4ce7-9db3-91d1ebe3ee71]: A cracked jade compass that Mira Venn keeps inside her right boot. Only her friend Oren Dask knows about it.\n  - GUARDS → Sablecross reservoir (reservoir) [ID: 2a3ca8de-f578-4c53-a2cf-78f147162aee]: A reservoir in Sablecross, historically fed by the Glass Aqueduct before its destruction in 204.\n  - UNRELATED_TO → Lysa Renn (person) [ID: 29ecd357-690c-4292-b52b-ade3cecc7021] [Aliases: Warden]: Lysa Renn keeps the Sun Archive and allows civilian scholars