data: {"type":"streamAssistantItem","item":"event","value":{"event":"end","part":1,"content":{"type":"text","text":"- Mira was born in Greyhaven, a small coastal town.\n- She keeps a cracked jade compass in her right boot; only her friend Oren Dask knows.\n- Oren—the reservoir Warden—requires soldiers to have a council permit to draw water. This is not Lysa Renn.\n- The aqueduct issue remains unresolved: it was permanently destroyed by a landslide in 204 and has not been rebuilt, with no bypass. A separate note says Mira opened its sluice in 206 and water flowed, which conflicts with that established canon."}}}

